  "segments": [
    {
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "接引殿裏的佛前燈一排一排的，每個頂着一顆小燈花燃在案子上。",
      "output_sha256": "1371efa962d69dcf1a3f99b7e4d8b6c3227c71a3dafa2c9636e0c9c5cf401fa1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 1,
      "source_human_sha256": "1371efa962d69dcf1a3f99b7e4d8b6c3227c71a3dafa2c9636e0c9c5cf401fa1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "敲鐘的聲音一到接近黃昏的時候就稀少下來，並且漸漸地簡直一聲不響了。",
      "output_sha256": "b50234b104357396ced3ee503d987cb4c220c9ea495a0c31c03033c1207a230b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 2,
      "source_human_sha256": "b50234b104357396ced3ee503d987cb4c220c9ea495a0c31c03033c1207a230b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "因爲燒香拜佛的人都回家去吃着晚飯。",
      "output_sha256": "4d021f66b0062e1815c7218ac826980ef83d365455e02730072ed30adcdd8e81",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 3,
      "source_human_sha256": "4d021f66b0062e1815c7218ac826980ef83d365455e02730072ed30adcdd8e81",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "大雄寶殿裏，也同樣啞默默地，每個塑像都站在自己的地盤上憂鬱起來，因爲黑暗開始掛在他們的臉上。",
      "output_sha256": "c50daa07aef688921bab6a44a3cba51c37fbbf1c76cb6fc214fced6b06628c5a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 4,
      "source_human_sha256": "c50daa07aef688921bab6a44a3cba51c37fbbf1c76cb6fc214fced6b06628c5a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "長眉大仙，伏虎大仙，赤腳大仙，達摩，他們分不出哪個是牽着虎的，哪個是赤着腳的。",
      "output_sha256": "92a28abdd8083904a2adc7062717d07b2d6047f8e5ed65209c01cc82f2564df0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 5,
      "source_human_sha256": "92a28abdd8083904a2adc7062717d07b2d6047f8e5ed65209c01cc82f2564df0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "他們默默地站在大雄寶殿的兩側，與其他名字各異的塑像一同靜靜守候。",
      "output_sha256": "66e8fcdfa5215bcb4ad5d2e49af543b30844d067c67d20645ca9bc6cd05f5f3f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": 0.449593,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        6
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "8f34f30458824d1bbdc62cc8759b656aca804d71e5f4850d97acccb9d7f90a7b"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_ai_sha256": "66e8fcdfa5215bcb4ad5d2e49af543b30844d067c67d20645ca9bc6cd05f5f3f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "只有大肚彌勒佛還在笑眯眯地看着打掃殿堂的人，因爲打掃殿堂的人把小燈放在彌勒佛腳前的緣故。",
      "output_sha256": "587588dfa964db640bdae60595d436396e1e139ef2fe9b703f95ca802573d0b1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 7,
      "source_human_sha256": "587588dfa964db640bdae60595d436396e1e139ef2fe9b703f95ca802573d0b1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "厚沉沉的圓圓的蒲團，被打掃殿堂的人一個一個地拾起來，高高地把它們靠着牆堆了起來。",
      "output_sha256": "b1b98ab9421e512c50853e8c01f6268b5472a929c8a94455276c357a4be58f0d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_human_sha256": "b1b98ab9421e512c50853e8c01f6268b5472a929c8a94455276c357a4be58f0d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "香火着在釋迦牟尼的腳前，就要熄滅的樣子，昏昏暗暗地，若不去尋找，簡直看不見了似的，只不過香火的氣息繚繞在灰暗的微光裏。",
      "output_sha256": "5446353f03b916a5d9dff3be66d8388d20d2621b62f836c763cac41bcca1993b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 9,
      "source_human_sha256": "5446353f03b916a5d9dff3be66d8388d20d2621b62f836c763cac41bcca1993b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "接引殿前，石橋下的池水裡的小龜，已不再像白天那樣把頭探出水面。",
      "output_sha256": "88eefec6215b874938be520c389eea758355bcacd79dd09957268809fe3ae8e7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": 0.679915,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        10
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "ea8e72178d1626c2a63f9bcf9710b8e4ed919d3a9bbe69d649e53486dc061835"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_ai_sha256": "88eefec6215b874938be520c389eea758355bcacd79dd09957268809fe3ae8e7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        10
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 11,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "用胡芝麻磨香油的小石磨也停止了轉動，磨香油的人正在收拾著器具。",
      "output_sha256": "2cb2f4750fdb89bc950b3cc384b48c0b12ed152f6f2ec3c57eaee6c590386cbe",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": 0.787189,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        11,
        12
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "d7e2b71c36d50a97eaa5b3df5d9f2a15e9e6b0684351187e309808e46f7b752b",
        "534e208a24eeffdfcf999f0649f303a8d7c02b036e4e430ce40381499266e3f9"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 11,
      "source_ai_sha256": "2cb2f4750fdb89bc950b3cc384b48c0b12ed152f6f2ec3c57eaee6c590386cbe",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        11
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 12,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "廟前喝茶的人們開始戴上帽子，準備回家。",
      "output_sha256": "d452defe8254d11bba9d6c28749e64797eee1f35433e2b0cd6b0b257f978e4fb",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": 0.557963,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        13
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "9e6ef6221f83475265c8104e7d4dfdfb87d020e7eda1fb630b5dd731fd0d2119"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 12,
      "source_ai_sha256": "d452defe8254d11bba9d6c28749e64797eee1f35433e2b0cd6b0b257f978e4fb",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        12
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 13,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "沖茶的紅臉的那個老頭，在小桌上自己吃着一碗素面，大概那就是他的晚餐了。",
      "output_sha256": "3d7f09c72cad606b894ff0ae3ec655a47de9689c6b955c2f5d4a9c3fc44c74da",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_human_sha256": "3d7f09c72cad606b894ff0ae3ec655a47de9689c6b955c2f5d4a9c3fc44c74da",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 14,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "過年的時候，這座廟宇更顯得溫暖而熱鬧，燒香拜佛的人們四處張望，悠閒地打量著石橋上的花紋，並試著多發現幾隻橋下的小龜。",
      "output_sha256": "f0b806ee58ec39ad99c50103dd4e6907b50d243c9ba37f03f294e1ffea6ad8d9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": 0.500811,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        15,
        16
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "0b62f0afa93fa64063d37cbc6da55814d461b07f3b80c687c68ca79af4c27549",
        "83150a44a46afff4fb4c627c84e776d48fd4336357eabd016be5528f5ce02e61"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_ai_sha256": "f0b806ee58ec39ad99c50103dd4e6907b50d243c9ba37f03f294e1ffea6ad8d9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        14
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 15,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "有一個老太婆揹着一個黃口袋，在右邊的胯骨上，那口袋上寫着“進香”兩個黑字，她已經跨出了當門的殿堂的後門，她又急急忙忙地從那後門轉回去。",
      "output_sha256": "bbd7696ae9b173d3612d3e2da799fa389980c7de417553de3f3531b123825aa8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 17,
      "source_human_sha256": "bbd7696ae9b173d3612d3e2da799fa389980c7de417553de3f3531b123825aa8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 16,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我很奇怪地看着她，以爲她掉了東西。",
      "output_sha256": "dafcb39d62597456ff0f13895c04b31aa434624a5d4ca6287b2ca62ba69d995b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 18,
      "source_human_sha256": "dafcb39d62597456ff0f13895c04b31aa434624a5d4ca6287b2ca62ba69d995b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 17,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "大家想想看吧！",
      "output_sha256": "c486bb8ff3a41087ad4120d73431d4fc04143f05bc8aa7558cedd403cb4396fa",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_human_sha256": "c486bb8ff3a41087ad4120d73431d4fc04143f05bc8aa7558cedd403cb4396fa",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 18,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "她一翻身就跪下，迎着殿堂的後門向前磕了一個頭。",
      "output_sha256": "2a40e0da427ecb0dbb4742abf7b6862eae594af1d7f0f59c71c68c274447359a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 20,
      "source_human_sha256": "2a40e0da427ecb0dbb4742abf7b6862eae594af1d7f0f59c71c68c274447359a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 19,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "看她的年歲，有六十多歲，但那磕頭的動作，來得非常靈活，我看她走在石橋上也照樣的精神而莊嚴。",
      "output_sha256": "c8bc40c5eb2e34344d2267f9be05fd63186ef23b62b7dab5c272126bfcea26d5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_human_sha256": "c8bc40c5eb2e34344d2267f9be05fd63186ef23b62b7dab5c272126bfcea26d5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 20,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "她所戴的新緞子帽在接引殿的光輝下閃閃發亮。",
      "output_sha256": "9cc9f823d22eec7981bb54fc202afdff452fcc63e5aa4ca9f1d69bacaa81d888",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": 0.393649,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        22
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "f611b39b5d75a4117782ab33a10fcb63c626590bd61401e16505b0c05c560b48"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_ai_sha256": "9cc9f823d22eec7981bb54fc202afdff452fcc63e5aa4ca9f1d69bacaa81d888",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        19
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 21,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "佛前的鐘在一位老和尚手中用鐘錘敲響了三聲，老太太便在蒲團上安靜地磕了三個頭。",
      "output_sha256": "fe7b2dea8ba9ea3b23de18fb4f212daf5cc8f6b8638876bef19b3631e8ac7047",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": 0.611603,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        23
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "5f6098357f65f52bb93b1d95a908afea29ecd913dcb5112f6af7c4df7e02aa7a"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 20,
      "source_ai_sha256": "fe7b2dea8ba9ea3b23de18fb4f212daf5cc8f6b8638876bef19b3631e8ac7047",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        20
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 22,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "這次磕頭卻並不像方纔在前面殿堂的後門磕得那樣熱情而慌張。",
      "output_sha256": "bf66819b265f23ca618c843c3376f35b6c4d2f09ad67e23a52de3cfa9f7755de",
      "alignment_unit_index": 21,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 24,
      "source_human_sha256": "bf66819b265f23ca618c843c3376f35b6c4d2f09ad67e23a52de3cfa9f7755de",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 23,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我想了半天才明白，方纔，就是前一刻，一定是她覺得自己太疏忽了，怕是那尊面向着後門口的佛見她怪，而急急忙忙地請他恕罪的意思。",
      "output_sha256": "0ac4ed59be9046f84a90e64be041e28f5b9d5ea661d77cb387ca42b020439428",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 25,
      "source_human_sha256": "0ac4ed59be9046f84a90e64be041e28f5b9d5ea661d77cb387ca42b020439428",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 24,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "賣花生糖的肩上懸著一個小箱子，裡面裝著三四樣糖果，花生糖、炒米糖，還有胡桃糖。",
      "output_sha256": "877b4304757fbd47697ee6907b8d4f27dae4e08415e136b57d017fd5251b22d2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 23,
      "alignment_score": 0.752737,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        26
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "d3ddfafa16020d72a9d420dc4684271199df50887e0b18b68ef14d90730c635b"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 23,
      "source_ai_sha256": "877b4304757fbd47697ee6907b8d4f27dae4e08415e136b57d017fd5251b22d2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        23
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 25,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "賣瓜子的提着一個長條的小竹籃，籃子的一頭是白瓜籽，一頭是鹽花生。",
      "output_sha256": "ce0aec2dfff1c426d09352612a4d20339e3b69db03b9e0ea92fa5c7d8e8114de",
      "alignment_unit_index": 24,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 27,
      "source_human_sha256": "ce0aec2dfff1c426d09352612a4d20339e3b69db03b9e0ea92fa5c7d8e8114de",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 26,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "在這裡，不流行難民們所賣的一包包“瓜籽大王”。",
      "output_sha256": "84b46e4fa79a1cb332eb4b7c18a133a0e64312e0ce634d75983e3818b6f68b9e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 25,
      "alignment_score": 0.661154,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        28
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "711d83247a67903dde43eb2ff29d5d52e0f4d610d040447f9c5f5db3eb19dced"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 25,
      "source_ai_sha256": "84b46e4fa79a1cb332eb4b7c18a133a0e64312e0ce634d75983e3818b6f68b9e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        25
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 27,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "青茶，素面，不加裝飾的，一個銅板隨手抓過一撮來就放在嘴上磕的白瓜籽，就已經十足了。",
      "output_sha256": "ea096f20949824525348e32a014729502234b6c85600941936d704e1df7a0603",
      "alignment_unit_index": 26,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 29,
      "source_human_sha256": "ea096f20949824525348e32a014729502234b6c85600941936d704e1df7a0603",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 28,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "所以這廟裏吃茶的人，都覺得別有風味。",
      "output_sha256": "8a63fe13737f4ec2f9a82ab5c0eee501fb35c07e8dbca6212b94b88ac9adf376",
      "alignment_unit_index": 27,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 30,
      "source_human_sha256": "8a63fe13737f4ec2f9a82ab5c0eee501fb35c07e8dbca6212b94b88ac9adf376",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 29,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "耳朵聽的是梵鍾和誦經的聲音；眼睛看的是些悠閒而且自得的遊廟或燒香的人；鼻子所聞到的，不用說是檀香和別的香料的氣息。",
      "output_sha256": "b4d64cc547aee680f133d3722df3da49738ba6eb0a28385f75e66f6f24936ba5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 28,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 31,
      "source_human_sha256": "b4d64cc547aee680f133d3722df3da49738ba6eb0a28385f75e66f6f24936ba5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 30,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "所以這種吃茶的地方確實使人喜歡，又可以吃茶，又可以觀風景看遊人。",
      "output_sha256": "a9710c69160df6f0d4645890c4160bb67680c4b509464b426701f33a1a8550ab",
      "alignment_unit_index": 29,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 32,
      "source_human_sha256": "a9710c69160df6f0d4645890c4160bb67680c4b509464b426701f33a1a8550ab",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 31,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "相比重慶所有的茶館，這裡更具魅力。",
      "output_sha256": "bb7c77f04074d7ce0651007b4963dd6de4af3e3a10fd0ce8895060a1c7ea0072",
      "alignment_unit_index": 30,
      "alignment_score": 0.466408,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        33
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "99b02587538c5343f262ddb0bdf534e215f16bd0667ba5fb2664e0cb4860b603"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 30,
      "source_ai_sha256": "bb7c77f04074d7ce0651007b4963dd6de4af3e3a10fd0ce8895060a1c7ea0072",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        30
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 32,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "尤其是那位沖茶的紅臉老者，總是神情愉快，走路時喜歡身體左右晃動，彷彿故意將重心放在左腿與右腿之間。",
      "output_sha256": "37c72102d20787c31aec2e07abe193dd41ca29a18dbebb8688c04d47f212e570",
      "alignment_unit_index": 31,
      "alignment_score": 0.511689,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        34
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "6def03dcc6837eebc369295034ecdfa97f7b5dc0055d5ef90793898898fce7ce"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 31,
      "source_ai_sha256": "37c72102d20787c31aec2e07abe193dd41ca29a18dbebb8688c04d47f212e570",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        31
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 33,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "每當他打開茶盅的蓋子時，話語便如泉涌一般，他說：“我們四川沒有什麼好的，要不是打日本，先生們也無法來到這裡。”",
      "output_sha256": "560f617cbb6338efc751015c3869cc847d117ae8fbbf7facbc6642c9ca6c9d24",
      "alignment_unit_index": 32,
      "alignment_score": 0.593602,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        35
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "c36cf33ad1646ceda42a838abd18375cd6596d4c6d1f16dd73b1baa121f53cae"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 32,
      "source_ai_sha256": "560f617cbb6338efc751015c3869cc847d117ae8fbbf7facbc6642c9ca6c9d24",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        32
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 34,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "接下來的話便聽不太懂了，似乎如詩句一般。",
      "output_sha256": "972efdda736a1dd6df0cbf1b0c003ba451ddf3f677482e1d28d22d6509f87901",
      "alignment_unit_index": 33,
      "alignment_score": 0.423889,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        36
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "882d38d93f11ded1a636bfe3a047b3e3a37abfeaa6d229608f0bf090f35faf32"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 33,
      "source_ai_sha256": "972efdda736a1dd6df0cbf1b0c003ba451ddf3f677482e1d28d22d6509f87901",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        33
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 35,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "這時候他要衝在茶盅開水，從壺嘴如同一條水落進茶盅來。",
      "output_sha256": "789aa58283c2716303c5d49da8c0bcd41a3baaab45bd3b7ebfd677a55a7f3954",
      "alignment_unit_index": 34,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 37,
      "source_human_sha256": "789aa58283c2716303c5d49da8c0bcd41a3baaab45bd3b7ebfd677a55a7f3954",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 36,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "他拿起蓋子來把茶盅扣住了，那裏邊上下游着的小魚似的茶葉也被蓋子扣住了，反正這地方是安靜得可喜的，一切都是太平無事。",
      "output_sha256": "97c296eebf4cec422468677a91e46a1d0937d8883bd68ef99974212e1127f0cc",
      "alignment_unit_index": 35,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 38,
      "source_human_sha256": "97c296eebf4cec422468677a91e46a1d0937d8883bd68ef99974212e1127f0cc",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 37,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "××坊的水龍就在石橋的旁邊和佛堂斜對着面。",
      "output_sha256": "29970500c5a00b7e125457c9e1e2a5e1c609abbe440f3c2e54c8025df9c4d0f3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 36,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 39,
      "source_human_sha256": "29970500c5a00b7e125457c9e1e2a5e1c609abbe440f3c2e54c8025df9c4d0f3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 38,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "裏邊放置着什麼，我沒有機會去看，但有一次重慶的防空演習我是看過的，用人推着哇哇的山響的水龍，一個水龍大概可裝兩桶水的樣子，可是非常沉重，四五個人連推帶挽。",
      "output_sha256": "fafbe083fb30cc637cf9cf8a1c75349556fe12913703cd2274ca487d2fde4a4f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 36,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 40,
      "source_human_sha256": "fafbe083fb30cc637cf9cf8a1c75349556fe12913703cd2274ca487d2fde4a4f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 39,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "若着起火來，我看那水龍到不了火已經落了。",
      "output_sha256": "0ca7ebfc9f9336d26a28a8dc6ffb2c56a0cf74dde17b9945640d5bbfd0a26091",
      "alignment_unit_index": 37,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 41,
      "source_human_sha256": "0ca7ebfc9f9336d26a28a8dc6ffb2c56a0cf74dde17b9945640d5bbfd0a26091",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 40,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "那彷彿就寫着什麼××坊一類的字樣。",
      "output_sha256": "7f7e8898bb7d62f4d5dce28c35100afe4a436923bae805dd1bc042b58d6fd5fd",
      "alignment_unit_index": 38,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 42,
      "source_human_sha256": "7f7e8898bb7d62f4d5dce28c35100afe4a436923bae805dd1bc042b58d6fd5fd",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 41,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "惟有這些東西，在廟裏算是一個不調和的設備，而且也破壞了安靜和統一。",
      "output_sha256": "9c32e7fb30bcac8ccfbb1d0c36fcf0907fceabb1881bc3efab9e5ea24d2f3f37",
      "alignment_unit_index": 39,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 43,
      "source_human_sha256": "9c32e7fb30bcac8ccfbb1d0c36fcf0907fceabb1881bc3efab9e5ea24d2f3f37",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 42,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "廟牆上，赫然書寫著“觀世音菩薩”四字，莊嚴而靜穆，這裡是重慶唯一一個未受外界擾動的聖地。",
      "output_sha256": "cf02fc964ffc0435b4405c8d12842fcc9279b9d6e060d8a537b00400f018f6d6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 40,
      "alignment_score": 0.473649,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        44,
        45
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "ced2c9c16e4f5c21b69e992af6e114289fe215d1f62d16a995894ed08b2395cf",
        "a1cf95468cbc83c364e6596afad498e66cd518927807eeae6bc58ac2a2252e5e"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 41,
      "source_ai_sha256": "cf02fc964ffc0435b4405c8d12842fcc9279b9d6e060d8a537b00400f018f6d6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        41
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 43,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "他說，一花一世界，這是一個小小的世界，應當如是觀看。",
      "output_sha256": "6d5c624a746e93ab35d9c38beb1fe6014362216becd6f3affe6c89ed32734da5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 41,
      "alignment_score": 0.775458,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        46
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "f37104dd13c41726afc5a64d4e902c51d9e9952c5411f4d775e49e4481870216"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 42,
      "source_ai_sha256": "6d5c624a746e93ab35d9c38beb1fe6014362216becd6f3affe6c89ed32734da5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        42
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 44,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "但我突然神經過敏起來——可能有一天這上面會落下了敵人的一顆炸彈。",
      "output_sha256": "134b0790fa72705b8f669506f0193c6f1a1ff23af4e4a5d8467c30dd24081c75",
      "alignment_unit_index": 42,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 47,
      "source_human_sha256": "134b0790fa72705b8f669506f0193c6f1a1ff23af4e4a5d8467c30dd24081c75",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 45,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "而可能的那兩條水龍也救不了這場大火。",
      "output_sha256": "58e8d9d5ee04f808b1245341e06c2655b0c7fecdebf53da3b2238e03beadefbe",
      "alignment_unit_index": 43,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 48,
      "source_human_sha256": "58e8d9d5ee04f808b1245341e06c2655b0c7fecdebf53da3b2238e03beadefbe",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 46,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "屆時，那些喝茶的人將無處可去，若他們不願意讓茶攤淹沒在瓦礫之中。",
      "output_sha256": "8b6f8b56f5dd88f2b90f2e4242bf0f8f7e8ce178e829671c5a8954855d389af6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 44,
      "alignment_score": 0.570245,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        49
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "43da3a44e47fec7ad3f3883262c07a9a939f95a2bba9e41d6468f55ee9d58170"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 45,
      "source_ai_sha256": "8b6f8b56f5dd88f2b90f2e4242bf0f8f7e8ce178e829671c5a8954855d389af6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        45
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 47,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我頓然地感到悲哀。",
      "output_sha256": "f48397a6d7e23aa7e3efda649008d262f3ccdd3ead5a2f2ab2ffb902d5b1490a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 45,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 50,
